   25                                   ;                                                                                                                 
   26                                   ; This source code was originally 'leaked' by 'JaySmith2000' in August 2008,
   27                                   ; who sold it on CD as part of a release entitled the 'Jaguar Sector II Source Code
   28                                   ; Collection':
   29                                   ;     https://web.archive.org/web/20131117222232/http://www.jaysmith2000.com/Jagpriceguide.htm
   30                                   ;
   31                                   ; This is a cleaned-up and commented version of the source code file 'horse.gas'.
   32                                   ;
   33                                   ; No code has been changed, so this source file can be used to create a build
   34                                   ; of Tempest 2000 that is byte-for-byte identical to the original 1994 release.
   35                                   ;
   36                                   ; All original variable and routine names are preserved. The changes include:
   37                                   ;   - Fixed up indentation.
   38                                   ;   - Added comments and routine headers.
   39                                   ;
   40                                   ; The home of this file and the rest of the Tempest 2000 source code is:
   41                                   ;     https://github.com/mwenge/tempest2k 
   42                                   ;
   43                                   ; horse.gas
   44                                   ; This module contains the GPU routine use for most drawing of solid
   45                                   ; polygons (polyo2d). It also contains the routine for drawing power-
   46                                   ; up explosions (pring2) and a sphere routine that is only used once,
   47                                   ; in head to head mode (psphere). 'psphere' is a near duplicate of its
   48                                   ; counterpart in ox.gas.
   49                                   ; **************************************************************************************
   50           =00F00000                       Base equ $f00000
   51                                   
   52                                           INCLUDE      "jaguar.inc"       ; Jaguar General definitions
